# This whole directory holds real credential files (#include'd from
# ../pjsip.conf and ../ari.conf). Nothing here should ever be committed
# except the .example templates and this file itself.
#
# The blanket `*` below already covers tls/ (a directory is matched and
# git never descends into an ignored directory looking for exceptions) --
# it holds the Meta SIP-TLS trunk's server cert/key (fullchain.pem,
# privkey.pem), either a self-signed placeholder or the real Let's
# Encrypt pair dropped there by docker/scripts/issue-cert.sh. Called out
# explicitly here since a private key is a much worse thing to
# accidentally commit than a SIP password.
*
!.gitignore
!*.example
